Work Order Body TK-20260919-9698 (Submitted on 2026-09-11, Source: Inspection Inspection)
Product link: SO-20261021-499862, categorized under 'Small Household Appliances'. The actual products sold are soft corneal contact lenses (contact lenses). The details page states 'Daily disposable pack of 30 pieces, can be worn continuously for 12 hours.'
Verification process:
1. This category is a Class III medical device and must have both the Medical Device Business License and the product registration certificate number;
2. The merchant qualification field is empty, uploading only one business license, and the business scope does not include medical device sales;
3. Three backend reminders (2026-10-12, 2026-11-01, 2026-11-17), merchants did not make up payment and replied 'Other sellers sell like this';
4. The page does not indicate any contraindications or wearing warnings.
Conclusion and recommendation: If the product is banned or lacks qualifications, the product will be immediately removed from shelves, and the store will be counted as a serious violation.
As a side note: A certain logistics dispatcher asked yesterday about the arrival time of B-18376, which has nothing to do with this work order. Don't order it together.

